qstit (3.0.1-1) stable; urgency=medium

  * Fix the crash at start-up in optimised builds, which kept Qstit from
    launching from the desktop
  * Start the text rotation at 0 and the jump step at 0.2 s, instead of
    whatever was left in memory

 -- Adamos Ttofari <adamos2468@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 11:46:23 +0100

qstit (3.0-1) stable; urgency=low

  * Port from Qt4 to Qt5 and Qt6; the Debian package now builds against Qt6
  * Show the projection window full screen and lay out from the window size
  * Let one line take the full screen height and measure the line boxes the
    way the text is drawn
  * Fix an out-of-bounds write when building the test card
  * Fix the arrow keys bringing back the previous line after jumping to
    another line with the mouse, "go to line", find or the info window

 -- Adamos Ttofari <adamos2468@gmail.com>  Sun, 22 Nov 2026 10:48:16 +0100

